---
// Bloques de Honor: Activos Ancla de Liquidez Inmediata (Oro & Magnetita)
---

<section id="anclas" class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Title (Animación de entrada) -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="0">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-coins text-amber-600"></i>
        <span>Doble Motor de Flujo de Caja & Volumen Masivo</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
        Activos Ancla de Rentabilidad Inmediata
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        El yacimiento cuenta con dos pilares de monetización temprana de clase mundial que blindan la inversión ante cualquier ciclo de mercado mientras se despliega la separación de tierras raras.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Two Monumental Honor Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-10">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Oro Nativo (Au) - CON ANIMACIÓN EN LOOP CONTINUO -->
      <div 
        data-animate="fade-up" 
        data-delay="150"
        class="gold-card-loop bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border-2 border-amber-400 shadow-xl shadow-amber-500/10 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-amber-500 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <!-- Haz líquido reflectante continuo -->
        <span class="gold-sheen-sweep absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-amber-400/20 to-transparent skew-x-12 pointer-events-none"></span>

        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-l from-amber-500 to-amber-600 text-slate-950 font-black text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 rounded-bl-2xl shadow-sm z-10">
          Valor Refugio & Liquidez Inmediata
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 text-3xl font-black font-mono shadow-xs">
              Au
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-950 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
                Oro Nativo de Placer
              </h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-wider">
                Recurso Aluvial de Alta Ley · Costa Norte
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Strategic Importance Box -->
          <div class="bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4.5 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-amber-950 font-bold block mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye text-amber-600"></i>
              Importancia Estratégica en el Proyecto:
            </strong>
            Es el <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">valor refugio y activo de liquidez inmediata</strong> de la mina, permitiendo generar <em>cash flow</em> operativo de inmediato para autofinanciar la operación y las plantas de beneficio mientras se desarrollan los proyectos de tierras raras.
          </div>

          <!-- Market Data & Valuation Grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider block mb-1">
                Cotización Récord (Sep-2026)
              </span>
              <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-950 font-mono">
                $4,330 – $4,400
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 block font-medium">USD / oz troy ($140k USD/kg)</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider block mb-1">
                Potencial Estimado In-Situ
              </span>
              <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-amber-600 font-mono">
                20 MM Oz
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-amber-800 block font-bold">USD $86,600,000,000</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Technical Test Evidence -->
          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Tenores reportados en arenas:</span>
              <span class="font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">65 – 75 mg/m³</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Cordones litorales concentrados:</span>
              <span class="font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">75 – 140 mg/m³ (>250 mg/m³)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Pruebas centrífugas Knelson (Playa Sur):</span>
              <span class="font-mono font-bold text-emerald-700">Recuperación > 55% Au libre</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 relative z-10">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-700 font-medium">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-500 text-xs"></i>
            Validado por 6 estudios (1982–2004)
          </span>
          <span class="font-bold text-amber-700">Sin cianuración química</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Magnetita (Fe) -->
      <div 
        data-animate="fade-up" 
        data-delay="300"
        class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border-2 border-slate-300 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/5 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-slate-800 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-l from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white font-black text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 rounded-bl-2xl shadow-sm">
          Sustento de Volumen & Acero Verde
        </div>

        <div>
          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl font-black font-mono shadow-md">
                Fe
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-950 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
                  Magnetita (Arenas Negras)
                </h3>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
                  Mena de Hierro de Alta Pureza (62–65% Fe)
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Asset thumbnail image -->
            <img 
              src="/assets/santa/magnetita.webp" 
              alt="Cristal de Magnetita Las Arenas del Santa" 
              class="w-14 h-14 object-contain filter drop-shadow-md hidden sm:block"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Strategic Importance Box -->
          <div class="bg-slate-100/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4.5 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold block mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-industry text-slate-700"></i>
              Importancia Estratégica en el Proyecto:
            </strong>
            Esencial para la <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">industria siderúrgica mundial en la fabricación de acero verde</strong> y separación por medios densos. Aporta un sustento de volumen masivo continuo y estabilidad comercial a gran escala a toda la operación.
          </div>

          <!-- Market Data & Valuation Grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider block mb-1">
                Cotización Internacional (Sep-2026)
              </span>
              <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-950 font-mono">
                $95 – $125
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 block font-medium">USD / ton (FOB/CFR según pureza)</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider block mb-1">
                Volumen Estimado In-Situ
              </span>
              <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-mono">
                700,000,000,000 TM
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-700 block font-bold">USD $700,000,000,000</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Technical Test Evidence -->
          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Arenas negras de Prioridad 1:</span>
              <span class="font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">Hasta 12% promedio Fe</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Arenas pardo-grisáceas (Prioridad 2):</span>
              <span class="font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">3% – 5% Fe</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Método de separación:</span>
              <span class="font-mono font-bold text-emerald-700">Separación Magnética Física (Bajo Costo)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-700 font-medium">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-blue-500 text-xs"></i>
            Ensayos petrográficos y de laboratorio
          </span>
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Embarque directo Salaverry (75 km)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* =========================================================================
     ANIMACIÓN EN LOOP CONTINUO PARA LA TARJETA DE ORO (Au)
     ========================================================================= */
  @keyframes goldCardPulse {
    0%, 100% {
      border-color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.75);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18), 0 0 0 1px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
    }
    50% {
      border-color: rgba(217, 119, 6, 1);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 35px -5px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.38), 0 0 25px 3px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    }
  }

  @keyframes goldSheenSweep {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(-150%) skewX(-20deg);
    }
    30%, 100% {
      transform: translateX(250%) skewX(-20deg);
    }
  }

  .gold-card-loop {
    animation: goldCardPulse 3.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .gold-sheen-sweep {
    animation: goldSheenSweep 4.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .gold-card-loop,
    .gold-sheen-sweep {
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
